00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://nadiazablahphotography.com/galleries/honduras/</guid><description/></item><item><title>About</title><link>https://nadiazablahphotography.com/about/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://nadiazablahphotography.com/about/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;Hi there,&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Welcome to my photography website. Here you&amp;rsquo;ll find a collection of photographs capturing the places I&amp;rsquo;ve explored and the people I&amp;rsquo;ve encountered throughout my travels.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Photography allows me to capture what it feels like to experience somewhere new, from its atmosphere and character to the people who bring it to life and the details that make it memorable.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;I&amp;rsquo;m particularly interested in the relationship between people and their surroundings: how places shape our emotions and perceptions, how people bring their own stories and emotions into these spaces, and how these interactions create something unique.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>